+   - `src/citesure/fetcher.py` — D7 fetcher: httpx + trafilatura, 5s timeout, 2 retries w/ backoff, max 10 concurrent (asyncio.Semaphore), custom User-Agent "citesure/0.1 (+https://github.com/DawnofGenX/citesure)", respect robots.txt, 24h disk cache keyed by URL+etag (store under ~/.cache/citesure/fetch/), support `file://` and bare local paths for offline use. Return clean text + metadata (status_code, etag, final_url, headers).
