+   - Update the CLI (`citesure verify <file>`) to run tiers 1+2 by default and emit these reports.
+
+7. **Tests** — extend `tests/`:
+   - `test_overlap.py` — overlap scoring unit tests (known-supported, known-unsupported, partial cases).
+   - `test_windows.py` — citation-anchored window logic (marker→claim unit; user excerpt option).
+   - `test_topk.py` — top-k passage selection.
